st option.":"暫停咗。履歷係第一個選擇。","Base Reached!":"到達基地！","Score breakdown":"分數明細","Total":"總計","Run":"運行","Layers descended":"層降咗","Best single drop":"最佳單次下落","Smashes":"粉碎","Time":"時間","Invalid actions":"無效操作","Journey stars: {stars}":"旅程之星： {stars}","Next: {name}":"下一個：{name}","Retry":"重試","Replay this stage":"重播呢個階段","Watch replay":"觀看重播","Menu":"選單","Back":"返回","Layer {n} / {total}":"{n} / {total} 層","SMASH":"砸","Layer {n} of {total}. Score {score}.":"{total} 嘅 {n} 層。分數 {score} 。","Stage complete. Total score {n}.":"階段完成。總分 {n} 。","Run over. Total score {n}.":"跑過嚟。總分 {n} 。","Combo bonuses":"連擊獎勵","Precision landings":"精確降落","Completion":"完成度","Time bonus":"時間獎勵","Shattered on a danger sector":"喺一個危險嘅扇區上面碎咗","Out of rotation budget":"唔夠輪流預算","Time expired":"時間已過","Run abandoned":"挑戰已放棄","Run timed out":"跑超時","Daily Drop — {date}":"每日掉落 — {date}","Drop!":"掉！","Go. {objective}":"去。 {objective}","Daily Drop — reach the base.":"每日掉落 — 到達底部。","Stage {n}: {name} — reach the base.":"{n} 階段： {name} — 到達基地。","Reach the base.":"到達基地。","Action not available":"操作不可用","Gap aligned — hold still!":"缺口對齊 — 保持靜止！","Rotate left ({n}° to go)":"向左旋轉（ {n} ° 去）","Rotate right ({n}° to go)":"右轉（ {n} ° 去）","Keep going.":"繼續行落去。","Replay — Esc to exit":"重播——按 Esc 退出","Watching replay of the recorded run.":"睇緊錄咗嘅跑步嘅重播。","Replay finished.":"重播完結。","Good! Rotation mastered — now reach the base, or leave from pause.":"好！掌握咗旋轉 — 而家去到基地，或者由暫停離開。","Lesson goal complete.":"課堂目標完成。","First Descent":"首次下降","Complete any stage.":"完成任何關卡。","Freefall":"自由落體","Drop through 4+ rings in one fall.":"一個秋天穿過4個以上嘅環。","Creature of Habit":"習慣嘅生物","Complete the Daily Drop 3 days in a row.":"連續 3 日完成 Daily Drop。","Crown of the Spiral":"螺旋之冠","Clear Journey stage 40.":"通過旅程第 40 關。","Thousand Layers":"千層．","Descend 1000 layers total.":"總共下降 1000 層。","Drop":"放下","Layer passed ×{n}":"層通過 × {n}","Combo ×{n}":"連擊 ×{n}","Precision landing":"精確降落","Danger sector smashed":"已摧毀危險區域","Danger sector — run over":"危險區域 — 跑完","Undone":"已撤銷","Stage complete":"關卡完成","Achievement unlocked":"成就解鎖","Ember Dusk":"餘燼黃昏","Deep Tide":"深層潮汐","Neon Orchard":"霓虹果園","Paper Dawn":"紙張黎明","Monochrome Signal":"單色訊號","First Drop":"首次落下","Steady Hand":"穩定單手","Around the Rim":"環繞邊緣","Long Way Down":"一路走落去","Rhythm":"節奏","High Tower":"高塔","Quickstep":"快步","Summit Drill":"峰會演習","Narrow Door":"窄門","Thread It":"串咗佢","Twin Turns":"雙轉","Patient Fall":"病人跌倒","Combo Shaft":"連擊豎井","Deep Combo":"深層連擊","Needle":"針","Mastery Ring":"掌握戒指","First Hazard":"第一次危險","Red Arc":"紅弧","Watch the Paint":"睇住個油漆","Hazard Pair":"危險對","Threaded Needle":"螺紋針","Split Decision":"分歧決定","Hazard Rows":"危險排","Mastery Fire":"掌握火","Drift Lesson":"漂移課","Slow Sway":"慢搖","Counterspin":"反旋","Drift Shaft":"漂移軸","Moving Target":"移動目標","Double Drift":"雙漂","Hazard Drift":"危險漂移","Mastery Tide":"掌握潮","Tight Squeeze":"窄位","Gauntlet":"挑戰","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Combo Weave":"連擊編織","Pressure Drop":"壓力下降","Long Fall":"長落","Last Door":"最後一扇門","Mastery Crown":"精通皇冠","Calm":"平靜","Standard":"標準","Expert":"專家","Minimal Touch":"最少嘅觸摸","Reach the base with a tight rotation budget.":"用緊張嘅輪流預算去到基地。","Speedrun Spiral":"速跑螺旋","Beat the clock to the base.":"趕喺時間到之前到達基地。","Needlework":"刺繡","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"好窄嘅缺口。精確度係一切。","Drift Storm":"漂流風暴","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"每一層都漂移。睇吓個動議。","The Long Drop":"長滴","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"四十層。耐力同神經。","Breaker":"破壞者","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"周圍都係危險 — 連鎖下落嚟突破。","Rotate the Tower":"旋轉塔","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"塔轉；個波唔係。用 ← / → 、 A / 啲、螢幕上嘅箭頭或者拖曳嚟左右旋轉。","Find the Gap":"搵個差距","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"將發光嘅間隙同個波一齊排，然後佢就會跌穿。經過每一層去到底部。","Danger Sectors":"危險區域","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"條紋扇區係危險嘅。千祈唔好落地喺佢哋上面 — 喺你跌落去之前旋轉過佢哋。","Combos":"連擊","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"穿過幾層而唔落地就可以獲得加分。對齊嘅間隙形成一個軸 — 釋放同跌落！","Smash Through":"砸穿","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball charges up — the next danger sector shatters instead of stopping you.":"一滴過3層，波就會充電 — 下一個危險扇區會碎裂而唔係阻止你。","Cancel":"取消","Erase":"清除","Key bindings":"按鍵設定","Open Options":"開啟選項","Progress erased.":"進度已清除。","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"已從你的 StarHermit 雲端存檔還原進度。","Run over":"局數結束","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"音量、靜音、畫質、語言、更大文字、高對比同減少動畫都喺 StarHermit 選項入面。"}
